  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>0</x>
      <y>0</y>
      <w>441</w>
      <h>774</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>The technical task
--
Brief
1. add/remove stream entities
2. create/delete RTSP streams ( stream entity should be created )
3. start/stop stream saving of video file to the Cloud
4. make snapshot of stream and send to the Cloud
5. make snapshot of stream and send to the UI by HTTP response
6. send camera addon events to plugin and broadcasts
7. change RTSP stream link in case the controller changes IP address
--
The issues should be fixed
-- random segmentation faults
-- camera addon stucks and doesn't respond on requests
-- camera addon should start streams are started before when camera addon is restarted
--
Detailed
-- add camera stream ( save to database )
    * emit start event if successfully created
    * emit error event if creating failed
-- remove camera stream
    * emit removed event
    * delete live stream
    * delete stream saving to cloud
    * remove from database
-- create live RTSP stream
    * emit start event if successfully created
    * emit error event if creating failed or stream wasn't added
    * if stream is not added then emit error
    * do nothing if live RTSP stream is created
-- delete live RTSP stream
    * emit stop event
-- if IP address is changed emit update event
-- start live RTSP stream after camera addon start if it was created
-- create stream saving to cloud with existing stream
   * prepare stream saving with given settings
   * start prerecord if needed
	* emit created event if successfully created
	* emit error event if creating failed or stream wasn't added
-- delete stream saving to cloud with existing stream
   * emit deleted event
-- start stream saving to сloud
   * emit started event
   * emit error event if creating failed or stream wasn't added
-- stop stream saving to cloud
	* emit stopped event
-- start stream saving to cloud  after camera addon start if it was created
-- make stream snapshot for UI
   * return error if stream wasn't added
-- make stream snapshot for cloud
   * return error if stream wasn't added
</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
